---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer><div class="shell footer-grid">
  <div><strong>PIKE.</strong><p>把喜欢的人和事，写得久一点。</p></div>
  <div class="stamp">P<br /><small>{year}</small></div>
  <div class="right"><a href="https://github.com/pike199761">GitHub</a><a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a><p>Made with curiosity.</p></div>
</div></footer>
<style>
  footer { margin-top: 7rem; padding: 2.5rem 0 4rem; border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); background: var(--orange); color: var(--ink); }
  .footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; align-items: end; gap: 2rem; }
  strong { font-size: 1.4rem; letter-spacing: -.04em; } p { margin: .25rem 0 0; font-size: .76rem; }
  .right { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: end; gap: 1rem; text-align: right; } .right p { margin-left: .7rem; }
  a { font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .stamp { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 60px; height: 60px; border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 50%; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: .8; transform: rotate(-7deg); }
  .stamp small { font-size: .5rem; }
  @media (max-width: 650px) { footer { margin-top: 4rem; } .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } .stamp { display: none; } .right { flex-wrap: wrap; } .right p { width: 100%; } }
</style>
